Update abd_utils.filter_buildings to modern geopandas/pandas APIs.

Two API changes since upstream's pins:
- geopandas 0.10 (2021) renamed sjoin's `op=` kwarg to `predicate=` and
  hard-deprecated the old name; geopandas 1.0 removed it.
- pandas 2.0 (2023) removed DataFrame.append(); the replacement is
  pd.concat([...], ignore_index=True).

Pure API-swap patch; no behaviour change intended.

